IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CCRDCFG.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT CFG-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-CFG-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
        ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS IS WS-CFG-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD CFG-FILE.
01 CFG-LINE PIC X(200).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-CFG-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-CFG-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-EOF PIC X(01).
01 WS-WANT PIC X(04).
01 WS-FOUND PIC X(01).
01 WS-P1 PIC X(08).
01 WS-P2 PIC X(12).
01 WS-P3 PIC X(03).
01 WS-F1 PIC X(01).
01 WS-F2 PIC X(01).
01 WS-I1 PIC 9(03).
01 WS-I2 PIC 9(04).
01 WS-I3 PIC 9(05).
01 WS-I4 PIC 9(03).
01 WS-I5 PIC 9(04).
01 WS-M1 PIC 9(13).
01 WS-M2 PIC 9(13).
01 WS-M3 PIC 9(13).
01 WS-I6 PIC 9(05).
01 WS-M4 PIC 9(13).
01 WS-I7 PIC 9(03).

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "CCRDCLP".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-CCRD-CFG.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-WANT
    MOVE CG-PRODUCT TO WS-WANT
    MOVE SPACES TO CG-KIND
    MOVE SPACES TO CG-NETWORK
    MOVE SPACES TO CG-CURRENCY
    MOVE 0 TO CG-VALID-MONTHS
    MOVE 0 TO CG-AUTH-DAYS
    MOVE 0 TO CG-PENDING-BPS
    MOVE 0 TO CG-BILL-INTERVAL
    MOVE 0 TO CG-GRACE-DAYS
    MOVE 0 TO CG-ANNUAL-FEE
    MOVE 0 TO CG-FEE-AUTH
    MOVE 0 TO CG-FEE-CASH
    MOVE "N" TO CG-CASH-ALLOW
    MOVE "N" TO CG-INSTALL-ALLOW
    MOVE 0 TO CG-MIN-PAY-BPS
    MOVE 0 TO CG-LATE-FEE
    MOVE 0 TO CG-INT-BASIS
    MOVE "00" TO CG-STATUS
    MOVE "N" TO WS-FOUND
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CFG-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/etc/cards.cfg"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-CFG-PATH
    OPEN INPUT CFG-FILE
    IF WS-CFG-ST NOT = "00"
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ CFG-FILE
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END PERFORM PARSE-LINE
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE CFG-FILE
    IF WS-FOUND = "N"
        MOVE "24" TO CG-STATUS
    END-IF
    GOBACK.

PARSE-LINE.
    IF CFG-LINE(1:1) = "#" OR CFG-LINE = SPACES
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-WANT WS-P1 WS-P2 WS-P3 WS-F1 WS-F2
    MOVE 0 TO WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-I6 WS-I7
    MOVE 0 TO WS-M1 WS-M2 WS-M3 WS-M4
    UNSTRING CFG-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
        INTO WS-WANT WS-P1 WS-P2 WS-P3 WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3
            WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-M1 WS-M2 WS-M3 WS-F1 WS-F2
            WS-I6 WS-M4 WS-I7
    END-UNSTRING
    IF WS-WANT NOT = CG-PRODUCT
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE "Y" TO WS-FOUND
    MOVE WS-P1 TO CG-KIND
    MOVE WS-P2 TO CG-NETWORK
    MOVE WS-P3 TO CG-CURRENCY
    MOVE WS-I1 TO CG-VALID-MONTHS
    MOVE WS-I2 TO CG-AUTH-DAYS
    MOVE WS-I3 TO CG-PENDING-BPS
    MOVE WS-I4 TO CG-BILL-INTERVAL
    MOVE WS-I5 TO CG-GRACE-DAYS
    COMPUTE CG-ANNUAL-FEE = WS-M1 / 100
    COMPUTE CG-FEE-AUTH = WS-M2 / 100
    COMPUTE CG-FEE-CASH = WS-M3 / 100
    MOVE WS-F1 TO CG-CASH-ALLOW
    MOVE WS-F2 TO CG-INSTALL-ALLOW
    MOVE WS-I6 TO CG-MIN-PAY-BPS
    COMPUTE CG-LATE-FEE = WS-M4 / 100
    MOVE WS-I7 TO CG-INT-BASIS.
